<!--
   Legacy backup rules for devices on API < 31 (ignored on API 31+, where
   data_extraction_rules.xml applies instead). Excludes the unencrypted
   scan-history database for the same reason as above.
   See https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/data/autobackup
-->
